{"id":"n87020-1-9","stage":5,"title":"헹구다 · 漂洗","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87020-1-9-1","ko":"엄마 시금치를 삶은 다음에는 어떻게 해야 해요?","zh":"妈妈，煮完菠菜之后要怎么做呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시금치를","meaning":"菠菜","explanation":"시금치：菠菜；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시금치","audio":"/audio/614bdb9f46c8e6faec34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15958","senseId":"1","lemma":"시금치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삶은","meaning":"煮","explanation":"삶다：煮；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"삶다","audio":"/audio/dd9b86f86267d3ba55a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62802","senseId":"1","lemma":"삶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음에는","meaning":"之后","explanation":"다음：之后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"4","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해야","meaning":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"3","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"614bdb9f46c8e6fa","term":"시금치","zh":"菠菜","audio":"/audio/614bdb9f46c8e6faec34.mp3","entryId":"15958","definition":"根部略粗且呈红色、叶子稍长且呈戟形的蔬菜，常用来凉拌或煮汤喝。","pronunciation":["시금치"]},{"id":"dd9b86f86267d3ba","term":"삶다","zh":"煮","audio":"/audio/dd9b86f86267d3ba55a7.mp3","entryId":"62802","definition":"放在水中烧。","pronunciation":["삼ː따"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"之后","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"某事结束后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。；应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示前面动作非常有必要或希望成为该状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9969ced31267f47c327f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87020-1-9-2","ko":"삶은 시금치를 찬물에 한 번 헹구렴.","zh":"把煮好的菠菜用冷水冲一遍吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삶은","meaning":"煮","explanation":"삶다：煮；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"삶다","audio":"/audio/dd9b86f86267d3ba55a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62802","senseId":"1","lemma":"삶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시금치를","meaning":"菠菜","explanation":"시금치：菠菜；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시금치","audio":"/audio/614bdb9f46c8e6faec34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15958","senseId":"1","lemma":"시금치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찬물에","meaning":"冷水，冰水","explanation":"찬물：冷水，冰水；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"찬물","audio":"/audio/658c6529afb87c66be35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71464","senseId":"1","lemma":"찬물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"一个","explanation":"한：一个","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"2","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"번","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"헹구렴.","meaning":"漂洗，冲，过水","explanation":"헹구다：漂洗，冲，过水；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"헹구다","audio":"/audio/c8c49f252677ed87453d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87020","senseId":"1","lemma":"헹구다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dd9b86f86267d3ba","term":"삶다","zh":"煮","audio":"/audio/dd9b86f86267d3ba55a7.mp3","entryId":"62802","definition":"放在水中烧。","pronunciation":["삼ː따"]},{"id":"614bdb9f46c8e6fa","term":"시금치","zh":"菠菜","audio":"/audio/614bdb9f46c8e6faec34.mp3","entryId":"15958","definition":"根部略粗且呈红色、叶子稍长且呈戟形的蔬菜，常用来凉拌或煮汤喝。","pronunciation":["시금치"]},{"id":"658c6529afb87c66","term":"찬물","zh":"冷水，冰水","audio":"/audio/658c6529afb87c66be35.mp3","entryId":"71464","definition":"冰冷的水。","pronunciation":["찬물"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"多个中的一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"dfccc17e2997aa8d","term":"번","zh":"次，遍","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3","entryId":"26846","definition":"计算事情次数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["번"]},{"id":"c8c49f252677ed87","term":"헹구다","zh":"漂洗，冲，过水","audio":"/audio/c8c49f252677ed87453d.mp3","entryId":"87020","definition":"放入干净的水晃动清洗，去除肥皂水或脏东西。","pronunciation":["헹구다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f139c2fba5d15aa6c9ad.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.54,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87020","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":164,"seq